== Trivia ==
*The '''Skeleton Horse Pet''' had a bug that allowed players to trample crops on other [[Private Island]]s while guesting.
*The '''Skeleton Horse Pet''' was the first pet added into the game, added via [[Changelog/2019/October 24|update 0.7.3]].
**The [[Snowman Pet]] was the second pet in the game, added via [[Changelog/2019/December 18|update 0.7.5]]. The other pets were added during 0.7.6, 0.7.8, and 0.8.1
*It used to be possible for players who abused bugs with the '''Skeleton Horse Pet''' to have their pet removed and be prevented from ever earning it again on that profile.
**These restrictions were lifted at some point with the new pet system.
